The '''Coin Peg''' is a special type of [[:Category:Pegs|peg]] that gives the player one [[gold]] when hit. In addition, certain [[:Category:Orbs|Orbs]] and [[:Category:Relics|Relics]] will interact with them and are referred to as [[:Category:Gold Orbs|Gold Orbs]] and [[:Category:Gold Relics|Gold Relics]] on the wiki.

==Version History==
*[[Update 0.9.05|v0.9.05]]: The [[Kobanorb]] can now activate Coin Pegs
*[[Update 0.8.5|v0.8.5]]: Introduced

